@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>ShopHub - Privacy Policy</PageTitle>

<div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <section>
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you provide when creating an account, such as your name, email address, phone number and shipping address. We also collect order details and product listings you create as a seller.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Your information is used to process orders, manage your account, improve our services and communicate important updates. We never sell your personal data to third parties.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>3. Your Shopping Cart</h2>
        <p>Your shopping cart is stored locally in your browser, so it stays with you even when you're not signed in.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We take reasonable measures to protect your information from unauthorized access. For your security, please use a strong password and don't share it with anyone.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You can review and update your personal information at any time from your profile page. To request deletion of your account, contact our support team.</p>
    </section>
</div>

<style>
    .legal-page {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px 0;
    }

    .legal-page h1 {
        color: #2c3e50;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .updated {
        color: #7f8c8d;
        font-size: 13px;
        margin-top: 0;
    }

    .legal-page section {
        margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .legal-page h2 {
        color: #2c3e50;
        font-size: 19px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .legal-page p {
        color: #555;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 0;
    }
</style>
